{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 100, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "it and that are equal on the domain of it (exhaustive)\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 100, "ok": true, "cmd": "equiv", "ucas": "it(x: u8, y: u8) = x + y\nthat(x: u8, y: u8) = y + x\nequiv it that", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "equiv", "equal": true, "exhaustive": true, "mismatch_points": 0, "method": "exhaustive"}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [], "proof": {"kind": "exhaustive", "text": "every point of the domain"}, "files": [], "text": "it and that are equal on the domain of it (exhaustive)\n"}, "isError": false}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 101, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "  word-level ring identity: no AIG built, no SAT search (1 parameter(s), polynomial normal form over Z agrees mod 2^32)\nit and that are equal on the domain of it (proved by algebra (no SAT): word-level ring identity: both sides have the same polynomial normal form over Z in 1 parameter(s) mod 2^32; checked on 4096 sampled tuples (8 values per parameter))\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 101, "ok": true, "cmd": "equiv", "ucas": "it(x: u32) = x xor 0\nthat(x: u32) = x + 0\nequiv it that", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "equiv", "equal": true, "exhaustive": false, "mismatch_points": 0, "method": "sat", "sat": {"result": "proved", "aig_nodes": 0, "conflicts": 0, "why": "word-level ring identity: both sides have the same polynomial normal form over Z in 1 parameter(s) mod 2^32; checked on 4096 sampled tuples (8 values per parameter)"}}, "notes": [{"kind": "bvproof", "text": "word-level ring identity: both sides have the same polynomial normal form over Z in 1 parameter(s) mod 2^32; checked on 4096 sampled tuples (8 values per parameter)"}], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "ring_identity_normal_form", "points": 1, "passed": true, "text": "both sides expand to the same normal form over Z; the difference is the zero polynomial"}, {"kind": "ring_identity_small_domain", "points": 4096, "passed": true, "text": "machine evaluation of both sides agrees on 4096 sampled tuples (8 values per parameter; wrapping at the result's width)"}], "proof": {"kind": "sat", "text": "proved by algebra (no SAT): word-level ring identity: both sides have the same polynomial normal form over Z in 1 parameter(s) mod 2^32; checked on 4096 sampled tuples (8 values per parameter)"}, "files": [], "text": "  word-level ring identity: no AIG built, no SAT search (1 parameter(s), polynomial normal form over Z agrees mod 2^32)\nit and that are equal on the domain of it (proved by algebra (no SAT): word-level ring identity: both sides have the same polynomial normal form over Z in 1 parameter(s) mod 2^32; checked on 4096 sampled tuples (8 values per parameter))\n"}, "isError": false}}
